    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「先輩は読書ですか？　お暇なら、すこし手伝っていただけませんか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「これも何かの縁ですし、って図々しいでしょうか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「えぇっと、本の整理をしてるんです。漫画とかラノベとか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「勝手に持って帰っちゃって返さないひとが多いらしくて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「このへんの棚がガラガラになっちゃってるんですよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「だもんで、とりあえず埋めとこうってことで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「古書庫からむかしの本をだしてきて収納してるんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「や、あたし図書委員じゃないんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「知りあいのあいかちゃんって娘がよく図書室の整理をしてるんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
